    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hooggii Efrayim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa iska hoogay taajka kibirka oo sakhraamiinta reer Efrayim, iyo ubaxa engegay ee quruxdooda weyn oo ku yaal madaxa dooxada barwaaqaysan ee kuwa khamrigu ka adkaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eega, Sayidku wuxuu leeyahay mid itaal weyn oo xoog badan. Sida roobdhagaxyaale ah, iyo duufaan wax burburinaya, iyo sida daad biyo xoog badan oo wax qarqinaya ayaa gacantiisu dhulka wax ugu xoori doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taajka kibirka ee sakhraamiinta reer Efrayim ayaa cagaha lagula tuman doonaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo ubaxa engegay oo quruxdooda weyn oo ku yaal madaxa dooxada barwaaqaysanna wuxuu noqon doonaa sida berdaha beergoosadka hortiis bislaada, oo ku alla kii fiiriyaaba markuu arko iska cuno intuu gacantiisa ku jiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu kuwa dadkiisa ka hadhay u ahaan doonaa taaj sharaf ah, iyo cigaal quruxsan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo kan garsoorid u fadhiyana wuxuu u ahaan doonaa caddaalad, oo kuwa dagaalka iridda ka celiyana wuxuu u ahaan doonaa xoog. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse kuwaasuba khamri bay ku ambadeen, oo waxay la dhacdheceen wax lagu sakhraamo. Oo wadaadkii iyo nebigiiba waxay ku ambadeen wax lagu sakhraamo, oo waxay aad ugu qasmeen khamri, oo waxay u habaabeen wax lagu sakhraamo. Riyada way ku ambadaan, oo garsooriddana way ku turunturoodaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, miisaskii oo dhan waxaa ka buuxsamay mantag iyo wasakh, oo xataa meel keliya oo nadiifsan lama arko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal yuu aqoon bari doonaa? Bal yuuse warka garansiin doonaa? Ma kuwa caanihii laga gudhiyey oo naasaha laga duway baa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, amarba amar, amarba amar baa lagu daraa, oo qaynuunba qaynuun, qaynuunba qaynuun baa lagu daraa, halkan in yar, halkaasna in yar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse bushimo dad qalaad iyo af kale ayuu kula hadli doonaa dadkan ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uu markii hore ku yidhi, Tanu waa nasasho, ee kuwa daallan ku nasiya, oo tanuna waa isqabowjintii. Laakiinse inay maqlaan way diideen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed erayga Rabbigu wuxuu iyaga u noqon doonaa amar amar lagu daray, iyo amar amar lagu daray, qaynuun qaynuun lagu daray, iyo qaynuun qaynuun lagu daray, halkan in yar, halkaasna in yar, si ay intay tagaan dib ugu dhacaan, oo ay u jajabaan, oo ay dabin ugu dhacaan, oo ay u noqdaan kuwa la qabtay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidaas daraaddeed kuwiinna wax quudhsada oo dadkan Yeruusaalem deggan u taliyow erayga Rabbiga maqla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idinku waxaad tidhaahdeen, Axdi baan geerida la dhigannay, oo She'oolna heshiis baannu la nahay, oo markii belaayada wax qarqinaysa ay dhacayso na soo gaadhi mayso, waayo, been baannu gabbaad ka dhigannay, oo waxaannu ku hoos dhuumannay daacadla'aan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eega, Siyoon dhagax baan aasaas uga dhigay, waana dhagax la tijaabiyey, waana dhagax geeseed oo qaali ah oo aasaas la hubo ah, oo kii isaga rumaystaana ma degdegi doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo caddaaladna waxaan ka dhigi doonaa xadhig qiyaaseed, xaqnimona waxaan ka dhigi doonaa xadhig miisaan leh, oo roobdhagaxyaaluhuna wuxuu xaaqi doonaa gabbaadka beenta, oo biyuhuna waxay qarqin doonaan meesha dhuumashada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo axdigii aad geerida la dhigateenna waa la burin doonaa, oo heshiiskiinnii aad She'ool la lahaydeenna ma hagaagi doono, oo markii belaayada wax qarqinaysa ay dhacaysona way idinku tuman doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay dhacaysoba way idin kaxaysan doontaa, waayo, waxay dhici doontaa subax ka subax, iyo habeen iyo maalinba, oo in warka la garto waxay noqon doontaa cabsi uun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, sariirtu way ka gaaban tahay in qof isku kala bixin karo, oo aad buu uga yar yahay wax qof huwan karo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu u soo kici doonaa siduu Buur Feraasiim ugu kacay, oo wuxuu u cadhoon doonaa siduu dooxada Gibecoon ugu cadhooday, inuu sameeyo shuqulkiisa, waana shuqulkiisa yaabka leh, iyo inuu falintiisa falo, waana falintiisa aan la fillayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidaas daraaddeed ha noqonina kuwa wax quudhsada yaan waxa laydinku xidhay idinku sii adkaynine, waayo, Sayidka ah Rabbiga ciidammada waxaan ka maqlay xukunkii baabbi'inta ee uu dhulka oo dhan la damacsan yahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhegta ii dhiga, oo codkayga maqla, dhegaysta oo hadalkayga maqla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kan beerta jeexa miyuu had iyo goorba beerta u jeexaa inuu wax abuuro aawadeed? Oo miyuu had iyo goorba beertiisa sii qodaa oo sii jeexaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markuuse beerta ciiddeeda oo dhan wada simo miyuusan ku firdhin kabsarmadowda, oo miyuusan khamuunta firdhin, oo sarreenkana miyuusan safsaf u beerin, iyo shaciirkana meeshiisii, iyo heeddana xagga darafka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, caqligaas Ilaahiisaa ku tacliimiya, oo isaga bara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, kabsarmadowda wax af leh laguma tumo, oo giringirta gaadhiguna khamuunta kuma kor wareegto, laakiinse kabsarmadowda siiqaa lagu garaacaa, oo khamuuntana ul baa lagu tumaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadhuudhka kibista waa la tumaa, laakiinse had iyo goorba siima uu tumi doono, oo ma uu burburiyo in kastoo giringirta gaadhigiisa iyo fardihiisuba ay ku tuntaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taasuna waxay ka timaadaa Rabbiga ciidammada, kaasoo xagga talada yaab miidhan ah, oo xagga xigmaddana aad ugu weyn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
